<mxCell id="l120" parent="1" vertex="1" value="a VIEW, not a copy &#8212; no data moved" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=8;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#2E7D32;"><mxGeometry x="464" y="624" width="100" height="14" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="l121" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&#10003;  one CSR bit; the transpose is built into the diagonal-banked VRF read path.
&#10003;  zero data movement, no second buffer, no memory round-trip.
